#: ../../../source/architecture.rst:6
msgid "The firmware turns an ESP32-S3 into a *plug, configure, play* robot controller. One firmware drives many chassis types; the TJC touchscreen chooses the chassis, maps motors to wheels, calibrates directions and saves the result to EEPROM. No rebuild is needed to change the robot."
msgstr ""

